{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Test_scan.Markdown_link_scan</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"neural_nets_lib","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Test_scan","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Markdown_link_scan","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Checking the closed inline-link dialect against repository source paths.</p><p>Closed dialect: single-line inline links with unnested labels and literal relative file or directory destinations, including angle destinations and optional titles, read by <code>Agent_notes_scan.links_of</code> unchanged. Reference links, images, HTML links, code spans, fences and HTML comments are outside it. Schemed and protocol-relative URLs are ignored. Single-slash root-relative destinations and relative paths containing escapes, percent encoding, queries, entities, colons or parentheses are refused. Fragments are ignored; general-document anchors are not checked.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Notes\"><a href=\"#module-Notes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Notes</span><span> = <a href=\"../Agent_notes_scan/index.html\">Agent_notes_scan</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-in_corpus\"><a href=\"#val-in_corpus\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> in_corpus : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-path_exists\"><a href=\"#val-path_exists\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> path_exists : <span><span class=\"label\">files</span>:<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The root directory has the empty normalized path; other directories exist when a source descends from them. The inventory itself contains files, not directory entries.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-relative\"><a href=\"#val-relative\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> relative : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-published\"><a href=\"#val-published\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> published : <span><span>(string * string)</span> list</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-check\"><a href=\"#val-check\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> check : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">exists</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">from_file</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t * string)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span></span></code></div></div>"}